WEBVTT

00:18:28.165 --> 00:18:30.609
Their answers are amazing.

00:18:31.387 --> 00:18:32.537
They're amazing.

00:18:34.075 --> 00:18:36.336
More than anything though,

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:41.789
I have become deeply acquainted
with my own points of encounter,

00:18:41.813 --> 00:18:44.315
my personal history around this word.

00:18:45.419 --> 00:18:48.442
Because when the N-word comes to school,

00:18:48.466 --> 00:18:50.522
or really anywhere,

00:18:50.546 --> 00:18:55.884
it brings with it all
of the complicated history of US racism.

00:18:56.639 --> 00:18:58.853
The nation's history

00:18:58.877 --> 00:19:00.369
and my own,